WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.540
Episode 20

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.540
The Day the Sun Falls onto Planet Balan <i>!!</i>

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.540
( Air date: Feb 16, 1975 )

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:27.600
Saraba Chikyuu yo

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:31.400
Tabidatsu fune wa...

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:40.550
...uchuu senkan Yamato

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:40.240
Space Battleship

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:40.240
<i>YAMATO</i>

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.000
Uchuu no kanata Iscandar he...

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.640
...unmei seoi...

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:48.410
...ima tobitatsu

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:51.510
Kanarazu koko he...

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:54.800
...kaette kuru to

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:58.320
Te wo furu hito ni...

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:03.600
...egao de kotae

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.710
Ginga wo hanare...

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:07.200
...Iscandar he...

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:10.400
...harubaru nozomu

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:17.100
Uchuu senkan Yamato

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:41.640
In 2199, Earth was attacked by Meteor
Bombs from the mysterious planet Gamilus...

00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:46.270
{SONO}...and mankind was facing extinction in one
year due to the radioactive contamination.

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:02.780
{CHIKYUU}The space battleship Yamato, the first
Earth ship to exceed the speed of light...

00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:07.170
{CHIKYUU}...has left for Iscandar to
obtain the radioactive purifier.

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:13.130
Galactic System

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:16.520
Iscandar is 148,000 light years
away in the Large Magellanic Cloud.

00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:17.440
Large Magellanic Cloud

00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:21.310
{GENZAI}Their current destination is
the mid-point, Planet Balan.

00:02:21.310 --> 00:02:24.580
{YAMATO}Balan appears to be a beacon
in space for the Yamato...

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:28.680
{YAMATO}...but it's also a Gamilus supply
base for the invasion of Earth.

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:30.180
Planet Balan

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:33.150
{Domel}After being assigned as commander of
the Solar System region operations...

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:38.350
{Domel}...a famed Admiral, Domel, has just
arrived on Planet Balan with his fleet.

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:40.730
{BALAN}Using Balan as
his main base...

00:02:40.730 --> 00:02:44.880
{BALAN}...Admiral Domel is like a space wolf
sharpening its fangs to kill the Yamato.

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:47.580
Admiral Domel

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:52.990
The Yamato is approaching Planet Balan.

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:05.770
Balan

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:05.920
We've made it this far.

00:03:06.730 --> 00:03:10.850
Hey, look. We've come
to the halfway point.

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:13.730
Chief Navigator,
don't relax too much.

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:15.720
It's only the
halfway point.

00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:17.430
Schedule is the only problem.

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:20.480
It's been 109 days
since we left Earth...

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:24.230
...but we should have passed
Planet Balan in 65 days.

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:25.680
Once we pass Balan...

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:29.590
...it's only 71,000 light years to
Iscandar in the Large Magellanic Cloud.

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:42.080
How big is it
in diameter, Analyzer ?

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:45.980
Approximately twice
that of Earth's.

00:03:45.980 --> 00:03:47.130
Hey, what's that ?

00:03:47.780 --> 00:03:50.010
Chief Combat Commander,
that's the sun.

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:51.230
Sun ?

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:56.070
Yes, but this sun is unusual,
and it's orbiting around Planet Balan.

00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:10.840
How is it, Captain ?

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:13.570
That's definitely Planet Balan.

00:04:13.570 --> 00:04:18.660
We've been navigating the ship using Balan
as if it were a lighthouse, so it has to be.

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:22.090
But Shima, it's best to be
as careful as possible.

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:26.040
She's right.  We'd better wait for the
report from the Chief Combat Commander.

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:58.440
Those plants are strange.
They're growing into the ground.

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:01.090
Chief Combat Commander,
look at that.

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:10.460
A base...?!
Isn't that a base ?

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:14.970
Kato, check that
crater carefully.

00:05:14.970 --> 00:05:15.860
Roger.

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:24.040
Captain, a report from Kodai.
He found a base on Balan.

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:25.590
A base ?

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:28.060
There's a base here ?

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:30.590
I wonder if
Kodai is alright.

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:48.340
Here they come.

00:05:55.070 --> 00:05:57.180
How could I get hit by
such pathetic attacks ?

00:06:06.680 --> 00:06:07.240
What're those ?

00:06:09.070 --> 00:06:13.720
Those are skeletons of Paranodons, the
same creature which attacked the Yamato.

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:17.190
It's horrible.
What happened ?

00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:25.640
Incoming message from the Yamato.

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:29.240
"Kodai and Kato, return
to the ship immediately."

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:33.070
Alright. My mind is made up after
seeing the corpses of Paranodons.

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:45.420
Kodai, leave them to me
and go back to the Yamato.

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:49.900
Idiot. Hey Kato, do you think you
can handle them all by yourself ?

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:52.130
Don't try to act tough.

00:06:52.130 --> 00:06:53.240
You can't do anything
with a scout plane.

00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:11.730
Analyzer, switch seats.

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:16.310
Kodai, hurry and go back !

00:07:17.150 --> 00:07:17.910
Roger.

00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:23.130
Analyzer, what're you doing ?
Roll it back !

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:24.340
Attack them !  Hey !

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:49.130
Hey Analyzer, wait here
until Kato returns.

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:55.290
Aihara, order Kato
to come back.

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:56.130
Yes, sir.

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:58.990
Yamato to Kato. Yamato to Kato.
Return immediately.

00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:04.120
Captain, let's destroy
the Gamilus base on Balan.

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:07.840
The indigenous Paranodons
were massacred.

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:08.850
Paranodon ?

00:08:08.850 --> 00:08:12.740
Yes. We should destroy
it for their sake.

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:14.140
Kodai.

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:18.990
The Yamato is behind
schedule by 44 days.

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:23.330
Unless it concerns us directly,
we should hurry to Iscandar.

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:26.290
Are you saying you don't
care about the Paranodons ?

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:32.240
Even if they're primitive,
I can't look the other way.

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:34.840
What do you think, Captain ?
Your decision, please.

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:38.630
We'll destroy the base.

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:41.880
We can't leave it there,
for the sake of the deceased.

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:45.100
Captain, Kato's Black
Tiger is returning.

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:59.400
Meanwhile, Admiral Domel has moved his
main fleet 500,000 km away from Balan.

00:09:10.970 --> 00:09:12.540
Calm down, Gale.

00:09:13.640 --> 00:09:15.940
Wait.
Just wait quietly.

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:19.800
Commander Domel, why do we have
to use such an irritating strategy ?

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:23.240
We already have enough
firepower to destroy the Yamato.

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:24.490
Don't be so hasty, Gale.

00:09:24.490 --> 00:09:28.270
Victory is all we need in war.
A flashy ball game isn't necessary.

00:09:28.270 --> 00:09:33.340
We showed them the dead Paranodons
to elevate their sense of responsibility.

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:36.290
In addition, they'll see
a lightly defended base.

00:09:36.290 --> 00:09:39.390
I don't understand.
How will that destroy the Yamato ?

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:43.280
The Yamato will fall
into my trap.

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:48.390
After seeing the dead Paranodons,
they should feel like they are saviors.

00:09:48.390 --> 00:09:52.540
But such cheap human compassion
can be easily manipulated.

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:54.540
The Yamato has come this far.

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:56.730
The more we increase the
intensity of our attack...

00:09:56.730 --> 00:09:59.830
...the more they strengthen
their sense of responsibility.

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:02.720
{SONO}That's why this
trap will work.

00:10:03.610 --> 00:10:07.140
Gale, we'll use the artificial
sun to destroy the Yamato.

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:14.530
As the Yamato advances,
our base will counterattack.

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:17.790
{TOUZEN}Naturally, the Yamato
will focus on the base.

00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:22.180
{SOKO}We'll drop the sun and destroy
the Yamato along with the base.

00:10:22.940 --> 00:10:24.180
Commander Domel...

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:28.810
{KIGAKARI}What worries me is that they might blow
up the sun with the Wave Motion Gun.

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:30.380
{WATASHI}But if my calculations
are correct...

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:34.390
...the sun should hit the Yamato
before they fire the Wave Motion Gun.

00:10:34.390 --> 00:10:38.140
Commander, if you
destroy the base...

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:43.940
Just watch. We just have to wait and
watch the movements of the Yamato.

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:46.770
The Yamato has entered
the base's firing range.

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:50.450
Good. Order all the anti-aircraft
weapons to intercept it.

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:27.990
All hands, battle stations.

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:34.810
Ready the missiles.

00:11:34.810 --> 00:11:36.490
Readying the missiles.

00:11:56.720 --> 00:12:00.750
Hey Ohta, pay close attention
to the sun, alright ?

00:12:01.390 --> 00:12:03.080
What's wrong with the sun ?

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:06.630
I don't have time to explain.
Just do what I say.

00:12:06.630 --> 00:12:09.140
Okay.  Watch the movement
of the sun with the radar.

00:12:29.020 --> 00:12:30.080
Incoming missiles.

00:12:31.530 --> 00:12:32.630
Fire the main guns.

00:12:32.820 --> 00:12:33.630
Firing the main guns.

00:12:43.130 --> 00:12:45.540
The Yamato is heading
for the Balan base.

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:51.400
It's approaching Hell.  Send
energy to the artificial sun.

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:53.500
Sending energy to
the artificial sun.

00:13:12.030 --> 00:13:13.560
Good.
Activate it.

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:59.610
What the...?!
The sun is moving toward us !

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:03.820
Ohta, don't be ridiculous.

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:06.490
I'm not lying.  Look.

00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:13.750
I...it's artificial.

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:17.650
Hey Shima, aim the bow
toward the artificial sun.

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:19.930
Only the Wave Motion
Gun can destroy it.

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:23.690
Can we make it in time ?
It takes a while to turn around.

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:27.980
We'll take attacks from
the Gamilus base directly.

00:14:28.650 --> 00:14:30.590
Fourth wave of
missiles approaching.

00:14:47.590 --> 00:14:50.280
Distance is 120,000 !
Descending faster !

00:14:51.190 --> 00:14:53.060
Kodai.

00:14:53.060 --> 00:14:56.440
You'll have control.
Let's trust the Wave Motion Gun.

00:14:58.190 --> 00:14:58.950
Aye, sir.

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:01.380
Prepare to fire
the Wave Motion Gun.

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:04.690
Charge energy.
Starboard full.

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:05.970
Starboard full.

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:17.480
Shima, how long will it take to
align with the artificial sun ?

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:19.370
At least 300 seconds.

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:23.230
Ohta, how much time do we have
until we collide with the sun ?

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:24.170
I'm calculating.

00:15:25.680 --> 00:15:27.390
290 seconds !

00:15:31.730 --> 00:15:35.010
It's finally changing
course, but it's too late.

00:15:35.010 --> 00:15:38.990
Before it finishes turning around,
the artificial sun will crush it.

00:15:38.990 --> 00:15:42.450
Watch, Gale, this is
how to win a battle.

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:48.570
How...how absurd !

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:06.700
Captain, the ship can't
take much more of this !

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:09.160
Missiles approaching !
Distance, 5000 !

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:18.590
Port side hit.  First armor
plating is severely damaged.

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:21.130
Shima, how much time do you need ?

00:16:21.130 --> 00:16:22.950
190 seconds.

00:16:22.950 --> 00:16:25.370
181 seconds till the
impact of the artificial sun.

00:16:29.710 --> 00:16:32.710
Stop the engine, and
descend using normal thrust.

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:35.360
Are you serious ?
The Gamilus base will destroy us.

00:16:35.360 --> 00:16:38.040
We have to lengthen
the time til impact.

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:53.140
Distance, 36,000 !
It's accelerating so fast !

00:16:53.140 --> 00:16:54.840
70 seconds till impact !

00:16:55.390 --> 00:16:58.490
Impossible. Are they going to
destroy their own base, too ?

00:16:59.070 --> 00:17:01.940
It's no good,
we're five seconds behind.

00:17:01.940 --> 00:17:04.610
Damn, is this the
end of the Yamato ?

00:17:15.660 --> 00:17:16.500
Captain.

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:18.540
I'm alright.

00:17:20.880 --> 00:17:24.340
This is the strategy
of Gamilus.  Incredible.

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:27.470
I've won.

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:31.130
Commander Domel.

00:17:31.130 --> 00:17:32.900
Incoming call
from Lord Desler.

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:38.210
You have a call
from Lord Desler.

00:17:38.210 --> 00:17:39.580
At a critical
time like this...

00:17:41.710 --> 00:17:42.690
Yes, Admiral Domel here.

00:17:44.070 --> 00:17:50.140
Admiral Domel, are you going to sacrifice
our Balan base just to destroy the Yamato ?

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:57.060
I'm glad Gale told me in time.
You're so wasteful.

00:17:57.060 --> 00:17:58.390
Don't do that.

00:18:09.340 --> 00:18:11.390
The artificial
sun slowed down.

00:18:13.790 --> 00:18:16.190
Shima, complete our
orientation now.

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:16.990
Alright.

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:25.370
Target scope open.

00:18:26.990 --> 00:18:28.910
Target, 8000 meters
directly ahead.

00:18:30.720 --> 00:18:32.780
Energy charge, 120%.

00:18:32.780 --> 00:18:34.140
Energy charge nominal.

00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:37.650
Ten seconds till firing.
Protect your eyes from the flash.

00:18:40.560 --> 00:18:41.350
Five...

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:42.010
...four...

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:42.900
...three...

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:43.730
...two...

00:18:43.730 --> 00:18:44.540
...one...

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:45.340
...fire !

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:44.390
Damn, at such an
important time...

00:20:17.470 --> 00:20:19.520
Geez, I thought we
were going to die.

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:21.800
We're so lucky.

00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:26.280
Besides, I wonder why that artificial
sun slowed down at that moment.

00:20:27.480 --> 00:20:31.680
Kodai, how did you know
it was an artificial sun ?

00:20:31.680 --> 00:20:35.110
You'll find out, once
Yuki returns with the samples.

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:35.980
Kodai.

00:20:35.980 --> 00:20:36.870
Sir ?

00:20:36.870 --> 00:20:38.800
Come to my
quarters afterwards.

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:39.570
Aye, sir.

00:20:54.180 --> 00:20:57.130
Kodai, I got the
samples you requested.

00:21:02.630 --> 00:21:04.030
Hey, isn't it wild ?

00:21:04.030 --> 00:21:06.340
Don't worry.
They're very gentle.

00:21:07.090 --> 00:21:10.790
But they attacked us in
a group the other day.

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:14.130
Those Gamilus bastards
are so cruel.

00:21:14.130 --> 00:21:16.940
How could they convert such a gentle
creature into a combat machine ?

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:20.520
Hey Kodai, what's your secret about
realizing that it was an artificial sun ?

00:21:20.520 --> 00:21:22.540
Did you bring
back any plants ?

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:23.140
Yes.

00:21:23.960 --> 00:21:27.680
Look at this paranodon.
The eyes are so small.

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:29.710
That means it's meant
to live in the dark.

00:21:29.710 --> 00:21:31.510
Here is a plant.

00:21:32.340 --> 00:21:36.380
I realized it for sure
when I saw this plant.

00:21:36.380 --> 00:21:40.030
{HORA}See ?  The ends of the
branches are growing downward.

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:43.380
{BALAN}It must need the
heat from Balan's surface.

00:21:43.380 --> 00:21:46.880
That's true. If there was a sun,
it should have reached out to it.

00:21:46.880 --> 00:21:51.700
When I looked at the sun,
I was sure that it was artificial.

00:21:51.700 --> 00:21:55.890
Our Chief Combat Commander
is unexpectedly detail oriented.

00:21:56.610 --> 00:21:59.820
Let's get going. We have to
leave as soon as possible.

00:22:08.160 --> 00:22:09.730
Kodai Susumu, reporting.

00:22:09.730 --> 00:22:10.680
Come in.

00:22:12.800 --> 00:22:14.300
Come over here, Kodai.

00:22:16.470 --> 00:22:19.390
Captain, don't
you feel good ?

00:22:19.390 --> 00:22:20.360
I'm tired.

00:22:23.220 --> 00:22:24.220
Kodai...

00:22:24.220 --> 00:22:25.320
Yes ?

00:22:25.320 --> 00:22:28.540
I have a favor to ask. Will you
substitute for me and act as the captain ?

00:22:30.350 --> 00:22:37.230
My body can't tolerate the heavy duty of
captain. I'll need a skilled support staff.

00:22:37.230 --> 00:22:40.130
But I can't...
I'm not...

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:41.540
Kodai.

00:22:44.360 --> 00:22:45.940
Understood, Kodai ?

00:22:47.310 --> 00:22:48.420
Yes, sir.

00:22:50.200 --> 00:22:51.970
Do your best.

00:22:51.970 --> 00:22:53.030
Aye, sir.

00:23:09.960 --> 00:23:14.070
The space battleship Yamato
has passed the halfway point, Balan.

00:23:14.070 --> 00:23:18.230
It has completed a quarter of
the journey of 296,000 light years.

00:23:18.230 --> 00:23:22.480
Yamato, hurry to Iscandar
in the Large Magellanic Cloud.

00:23:22.480 --> 00:23:25.230
The people on Earth are
waiting for your return.

00:23:25.230 --> 00:23:28.960
Mankind will be
extinct in 253 days.

00:23:28.960 --> 00:23:31.430
Only 253 days are left.

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:37.140
253 days left until the destruction of Earth

00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:45.030
Okita Juzo:

00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:45.030
Naya Goro

00:23:44.840 --> 00:23:53.440
Anoko ga futteita makka na scarf

00:23:45.280 --> 00:23:50.530
Sanada Shiro:

00:23:45.280 --> 00:23:50.530
Aono Takeshi

00:23:50.790 --> 00:23:56.020
Analyzer:

00:23:50.790 --> 00:23:56.020
Ogata Kenichi

00:23:53.440 --> 00:24:02.240
Dareno tame da to omotte iruka

00:23:56.710 --> 00:24:06.210
Note:
Kodai and Analyzer investigate on the
Type-100 scout plane. It's supposed to have tandem seats, but it had transverse seats.
Is it because they didn't think the rear seat could be used for piloting ?

00:24:02.240 --> 00:24:10.540
Dare no tame demo ii ja nai ka

00:24:06.210 --> 00:24:16.210
Note:
